    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The operation of this game is very unique. It is recommended to watch the How-to- play video at the top of the page before trying it.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a minesweeper game from a third-person perspective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Marking all mines is the task of each level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198820/extras/f82871d31ef4fea4911a3ac9e6443fd6.poster.avif?t=1752886330\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198820/extras/f82871d31ef4fea4911a3ac9e6443fd6.webm?t=1752886330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198820/extras/f82871d31ef4fea4911a3ac9e6443fd6.mp4?t=1752886330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minefields may be covered by obstacles and can be cleared by blasting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198820/extras/fede7ace89218bae13bbdb3004d76462.poster.avif?t=1752886330\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198820/extras/fede7ace89218bae13bbdb3004d76462.webm?t=1752886330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198820/extras/fede7ace89218bae13bbdb3004d76462.mp4?t=1752886330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the levels, you will encounter guards who prevent your action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have a wealth of skills to fight them,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-to-hand combat is your basic skill.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198820/extras/20439928ce3bf00d016f9f20dc29dcab.poster.avif?t=1752886330\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198820/extras/20439928ce3bf00d016f9f20dc29dcab.webm?t=1752886330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198820/extras/20439928ce3bf00d016f9f20dc29dcab.mp4?t=1752886330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lightning is a great way to hit a single target at medium to long range.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198820/extras/70f1824fb6ccfde022fcf2a78dc1c887.poster.avif?t=1752886330\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198820/extras/70f1824fb6ccfde022fcf2a78dc1c887.webm?t=1752886330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198820/extras/70f1824fb6ccfde022fcf2a78dc1c887.mp4?t=1752886330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blastwaves can be used against multiple targets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198820/extras/f48d7840753e783450629c076219edc1.poster.avif?t=1752886330\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198820/extras/f48d7840753e783450629c076219edc1.webm?t=1752886330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198820/extras/f48d7840753e783450629c076219edc1.mp4?t=1752886330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sniper aiming is sometimes necessary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198820/extras/372f00f7cfdf1a4badfe78ae8be0876e.poster.avif?t=1752886330\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198820/extras/372f00f7cfdf1a4badfe78ae8be0876e.webm?t=1752886330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198820/extras/372f00f7cfdf1a4badfe78ae8be0876e.mp4?t=1752886330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes, you can even fly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many more skills that you are welcome to experience for yourself once you enter the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a game that pays homage to Minesweeper, Bomberman, Tetris, and believe that you deserve it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198820/extras/b70c18bae115e5d87df762f576abfa6c.poster.avif?t=1752886330\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198820/extras/b70c18bae115e5d87df762f576abfa6c.webm?t=1752886330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198820/extras/b70c18bae115e5d87df762f576abfa6c.mp4?t=1752886330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The operation of this game is very unique. It is recommended to watch the How-to- play video at the top of the page before trying it.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a minesweeper game from a third-person perspective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Marking all mines is the task of each level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198820/extras/f82871d31ef4fea4911a3ac9e6443fd6.poster.avif?t=1752886330\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198820/extras/f82871d31ef4fea4911a3ac9e6443fd6.webm?t=1752886330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198820/extras/f82871d31ef4fea4911a3ac9e6443fd6.mp4?t=1752886330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minefields may be covered by obstacles and can be cleared by blasting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198820/extras/fede7ace89218bae13bbdb3004d76462.poster.avif?t=1752886330\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198820/extras/fede7ace89218bae13bbdb3004d76462.webm?t=1752886330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198820/extras/fede7ace89218bae13bbdb3004d76462.mp4?t=1752886330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the levels, you will encounter guards who prevent your action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have a wealth of skills to fight them,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-to-hand combat is your basic skill.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198820/extras/20439928ce3bf00d016f9f20dc29dcab.poster.avif?t=1752886330\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198820/extras/20439928ce3bf00d016f9f20dc29dcab.webm?t=1752886330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198820/extras/20439928ce3bf00d016f9f20dc29dcab.mp4?t=1752886330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lightning is a great way to hit a single target at medium to long range.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198820/extras/70f1824fb6ccfde022fcf2a78dc1c887.poster.avif?t=1752886330\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198820/extras/70f1824fb6ccfde022fcf2a78dc1c887.webm?t=1752886330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198820/extras/70f1824fb6ccfde022fcf2a78dc1c887.mp4?t=1752886330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blastwaves can be used against multiple targets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198820/extras/f48d7840753e783450629c076219edc1.poster.avif?t=1752886330\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198820/extras/f48d7840753e783450629c076219edc1.webm?t=1752886330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198820/extras/f48d7840753e783450629c076219edc1.mp4?t=1752886330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sniper aiming is sometimes necessary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198820/extras/372f00f7cfdf1a4badfe78ae8be0876e.poster.avif?t=1752886330\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198820/extras/372f00f7cfdf1a4badfe78ae8be0876e.webm?t=1752886330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198820/extras/372f00f7cfdf1a4badfe78ae8be0876e.mp4?t=1752886330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes, you can even fly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many more skills that you are welcome to experience for yourself once you enter the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a game that pays homage to Minesweeper, Bomberman, Tetris, and believe that you deserve it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198820/extras/b70c18bae115e5d87df762f576abfa6c.poster.avif?t=1752886330\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198820/extras/b70c18bae115e5d87df762f576abfa6c.webm?t=1752886330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198820/extras/b70c18bae115e5d87df762f576abfa6c.mp4?t=1752886330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
